{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and grab it. If not, scan area. Then move to destination and process object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = MoveToDestination    />\"",
